DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Utah: State individual estimated tax payment due
DESCRIPTION:Utah has no quarterly-installment estimated tax regime. Instead
 \, individuals must prepay (via withholding or a single payment) by the ret
 urn's original due date (April 15\, 2026) to avoid a penalty - a single pre
 payment threshold\, not four quarterly vouchers. | Utah has no quarterly-in
 stallment estimated tax regime. Instead\, individuals must prepay (via with
 holding or a single payment) by the return's original due date (April 15\, 
 2026) to avoid a penalty - a single prepayment threshold\, not four quarter
 ly vouchers. | Authority: Direct fetch of Utah's own tax agency instruction
