  year-end\, or the federal due date if later. | Utah partnership return due
  the 15th day of the 4th month after year-end\, or the federal due date if 
 later. Automatic 5-month extension (filing only\, not payment) - no extensi
 on form required. | Authority: Utah State Tax Commission\, direct fetch thi
 s session: "The return is due on or before the 15th day of the fourth month
  following the close of the tax year or the due date of the federal return\
 , whichever is later" and "Partnerships are automatically allowed an extens
 ion of up to five months to file a return without filing an extension form.
 " | Source: https://files.tax.utah.gov/tax/forms/current/tc-65inst.pdf | Th
